L59: In addition, the results of experiments showed that there were no significant differences in hemolysate SOD and GPx activity as well as serum total antioxidant capacity between the supplemented and non-supplemented groups (Table  2 ). However, the activity of both SOD and GPx within the soleus muscle was significantly higher in the non-supplemented group vs. supplemented group. These results are presented in Table  2 .
